        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 188,
        "headingId": 379,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Unknown</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:37:45"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 473,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Macroscopic appearance",
    "headingPosition": 11,
    "headingid": 386,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63324,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 188,
        "headingId": 386,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>There is no macroscopic lesion.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:37:45"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 467,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Histopathology",
    "headingPosition": 12,
    "headingid": 380,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63325,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 188,
        "headingId": 380,
        "headingText": "<p>The tubal lining is partly replaced by a monolayer of bland mucinous cells. Accompanying chronic inflammation and other metaplasias, such as transitional cell metaplasia, may be seen {21131836}. The differential diagnosis includes spread of well-differentiated mucinous tumours to the tubal mucosa, which can produce an appearance that is indistinguishable, but the immunoprofile reflects the primary carcinoma {25025442; 24901398}. Mucinous metaplasia is positive for CK7 and CK20. In one report HIK1083, claudin-18, and MUC6 expression was reported {27662036}.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-26T15:00:19"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 468,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Cytology",
    "headingPosition": 13,
    "headingid": 381,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 63326,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 188,
        "headingId": 381,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not clinically relevant</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-25T15:37:45"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 469,
